                <mxCell id="201" value="&lt;b&gt;STAGE 1 — Characterize Behavior&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Agent: &lt;i&gt;characterization-tester&lt;/i&gt;  ·  Skill: &lt;i&gt;characterization-methodology&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reads source, docs, configs, existing tests. Runs safe focused commands.&lt;br&gt;Writes golden-file / assertion tests into the repo&#39;s test structure." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;spacingLeft=12;arcSize=5;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="410" y="200" width="510" height="86" as="geometry"/>
